  {
   "q": "What's a Caseta plug-in dimmer?",
   "a": "A module that plugs into a wall outlet and dims a lamp plugged into it, controlled from the Lutron app, a Pico remote, or Alexa, Google, and Apple Home through the Lutron bridge."
  },
  {
   "q": "Does it need the Lutron bridge?",
   "a": "For app and voice control, yes. Without the bridge you can still pair it straight to a Pico remote."
  },
  {
   "q": "What bulbs work?",
   "a": "Dimmable LED and incandescent bulbs. Check the wattage limit on the listing."
  }
